offset_top = 10.0
offset_right = 500.0
offset_bottom = 220.0
text = "TEST 3+4: Terrain-Aware Puddle

Two test areas:
  LEFT: Flat terrain (simple)
  RIGHT: Hilly terrain (tests conforming)

Controls:
  P - Start/Stop puddle expansion
  + / = - Increase expansion speed
  - - Decrease expansion speed
  R - Reset puddle
  L - Find and mark lowest point (red sphere)
  TAB - Toggle freecam

Watch puddles conform to terrain height!
The lowest point shows where water would pool."
